    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44974" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὖρος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the East wind</i> (later, as
			dist. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπηλιώτης</span>,
			<u>ESE.</u>), <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.145
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				363b21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mu.</u>
				394b20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1308
			</span></i>, etc. (Connected with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠώς</span>
			by <i><span class="en">
				Gell.
				2.22.7
			</span></i>, with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔρα</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Vitr.
				1.6.11
			</span></i>. Possibly from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὕω</span>,
			because <i>parching.</i>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
